* '''[[DC Comics Presents Vol 2|DC Comics Presents (Volume 2)]]''' was an 8-issue miniseries paying tribute to the recently departed DC editor [[Julius Schwartz]]. A hallmark of Julius Schwartz' incredible editorial vision was his ability to conceive imaginative covers to serve as springboards for writers in need of story ideas. The one-shots in this series feature creators following the same guidelines with homages to old comics covers.
