| Trivia              = 
* The cover to this issue, by [[Adam Hughes]], is an homage to the cover of {{c|Batman #183}} by [[Carmine Infantino]] and [[Joe Giella]].
** Whereas the original cover used the [[Batman (1966 TV Series)]] logo on the television [[Bruce Wayne (Earth-One)|Batman]] is watching, the updated cover uses the logo of the relatively new show ''[[The Batman (TV Series)|The Batman]]''.
* The first story contains many clear homages to the ''[[Batman (1966 TV Series)|Batman]]'' television program of the 1960's. 
