| StoryTitle1         = Vast Colors in the Dark
| Synopsis1           = 
On an unusually warm [[Gotham City]] evening, [[James Gordon (Prime Earth)|Jim Gordon]], now a beat cop working with Officer Espinoza, witnesses an escaped [[Waylon Jones (Prime Earth)|Killer Croc]] and calls for backup.

At [[Arkham Tower]]s, a tired Batman discusses [[Waylon Jones (Prime Earth)|Waylon]]'s state with Dr. [[Annika Zeller (Prime Earth)|Annika Zeller]] while investigating his destroyed cell. She tells [[Bruce Wayne (Prime Earth)|Batman]] that Waylon is regressing after being exposed to unknown morphotoxins. Batman glides from [[Arkham Tower]]s to the [[Batmobile]], where he speaks to a hallucination of [[Alfred Pennyworth (Prime Earth)|Alfred]]. 

In [[Robinson Park]], two girls are being chased by a new gang, The Creeps, when the [[Batmobile]] slams into the gang. [[Batman]] helps the two girls and leaves for the [[Gotham Natural History Museum]]. 

In the museum, Batman finds Waylon and prepares to fight, but after being talked down by the hallucinatory Alfred, Batman decides to talk to him instead. Batman and Waylon talk about dinosaurs and how Waylon's "head is bad" before Dr. Zeller appears to take him back to Arkham Towers. Waylon gives Batman one of his toy dinosaurs and leaves with Dr. Zeller. 

Upon returning to [[Pennyworth Manor]], [[Timothy Drake (Prime Earth)|Tim Drake]] calls Batman on the emergency frequency after being cornered by the police.


