* Jacob Horgan has been promoted to Mayor of Gotham City in the wake of [[Christopher Nakano (Prime Earth)|Chris Nakano's]] death, which [[Batman Vol 3 153|occurred]] during ''[[Batman: The Dying City|The Dying City]]'' storyline.
** However, it will be later revealed that a mayoral electoral campaign is ongoing by the time these events take place.<ref>{{c|Batman Vol 4 8}}</ref>
