| StoryTitle1             = Last Legs
| Synopsis1               = [[Otto Octavius (Earth-616)|Doctor Octopus]] learns from a doctor that due to the beatings he received over the years has left him terminally ill and with only a year left to live. Four months later after he and [[Matthew Murdock (Earth-616)|Daredevil]] take down the [[Bar with No Name|Bar with]] and get it shut down due to the owner Deke not having a liquor license, [[Peter Parker (Earth-616)|Spider-Man]] offers to let DD know who he is, since he knows DD's secret identity. DD admits Spider-Man has some strange power that prevents his heightened senses from identifying Spider-Man's real identity, but refuses, stating it is better for him not to know to help maintain this protection, since he had to deal with a tragic love life with most of the women he loved ended up either dead or incapacitated for knowing his secret identity.

For Peter Parker, he is preparing for his Aunt [[Maybelle Parker (Earth-616)|May's]] ceremony for her re-marriage to [[Jay Jameson|J. Jonah Jameson Sr.]], and invites his friends. Learning of the upcoming ceremony, Dr. Octopus kidnaps Jay with his new miniature Octopus drones. He then starts a connection from his underground base causing havoc within [[New York City|New York's]] computer network after making a public broadcast, but Spidey's teammates in the [[New Avengers (Earth-616)|New Avengers]] arrive and deal with the chaos leaving  Spider-Man track down Dr. Octopus. When [[Carlie Cooper (Earth-616)|Carlie Cooper]] and [[Norah Winters (Earth-616)|Norah Winters]] track down Octopus' signal from the drone they found in Jay's apartment and Carlie contacts Peter and mentions what they are doing, they are captured just as Peter urges her for both of them to flee. Meeting with the [[Fantastic Four (Earth-616)|Fantastic Four]] who are working on creating a device to jam Octavius' signal, [[Reed Richards (Earth-616)|Mister Fantastic]] has [[Jonathan Storm (Earth-616)|Johnny Storm]] work on tracing the signal from Carlie's cell phone.

Arriving at the location the two quickly locate Octavius' signal and after freeing the girls and Jay, Spider-Man leaves it to Johnny to get them outside while he faces Dr. Octopus alone. Despite [[Doctor Octopus' Tentacles|Octopus'tentacles]] and mini-drones, Spider-Man distracts him by forcing him to hold up a column while he takes Dr. Octopus' neural device and uses it disable Dr. Octopus' control of his tentacles. He then uses it to undo the damage that Dr. Octopus caused, but Dr. Octopus has his mini-drones cover Spider-Man, and though Johnny burns them off of him, Dr. Octopus had escaped in the confusion. Outside Spider-Man admits to the Fantastic Four and New Avengers that DD was right about the risks in exposing his secret identity, and though he is concerned that the neural device uploaded his secret identity into the city's computers, Reed Richards states he is handling that situation.

Afterwards Peter and Johnny with [[Michele Gonzales (Earth-616)|Michele Gonzales]] and Carlie Cooper as their dates attend the wedding. After the vows are done and May throws her bouquet, it falls into the hands of a guest who has just arrived: [[Mary Jane Watson (Earth-616)|Mary Jane Watson]].

